  "report_sha256": "7af092282dfda5070c4dbf1006daa8cff22a218487af28e40b59e8dc51894c7c",
  "scope": "Two workloads, each with two reversed-order repetitions of both maintenance modes on independent seeds. Matched operations, admitted and stored states, closure, next selections and persistent deltas are identical. Independent cold replay forbids fresh recognition and reference solving, checks all eight arms and all 3734 reference nodes, and compares four stepwise prefixes with complete rebuilt catalogs, route ordering and activation statistics. Historical completion reproduces the previous checkpoint. Current bounded partial expansion adds 32 patterns and three splits but coverage remains 66/83; its pending target is unadmitted and no entered state is unstored. All 1009 previously manifested artifacts and all 3575 prior reference payloads are unchanged. Preparation, acquisition, selection, maintenance, export and cold replay remain charged. Additional in-memory index storage is reported as counts, not measured peak RAM. No holdout estimate, minimum-expansion proof, persistent-space saving or unrestricted-SAT bound is claimed.",
